DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstantFunctions=>0);
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstants=>0);

$fun_2 = Formula("sqrt((sin(x)))");
$fun_1 = Formula("e^((8-x))");

Context("Interval");

$set_ans_4 = Compute("(-infinity, 12] U (((({-1, 1, 3} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-1, 1, 3})) - ((-infinity, infinity) - ({-1, 1, 3} U ({-1, 1, 3} U {-1, 1, 3}))))) U (((-infinity, 12] U {-1, 1, 3} U {-1, 1, 3} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 12])) U (-infinity, 12] U {-1, 1, 3}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 12])) U ((-infinity, 12] U {-1, 1, 3})");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("{-1, 1, 3} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-1, 1, 3}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 12])");
$set_ans_6 = Compute("(-infinity, 12] U {-1, 1, 3} U (-infinity, 12]");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("((1, 14) - ([2, 11] U [2, 11] U ((1, 14) U (1, 14) U {-5, -3, 0, 3, 4, 9} - ((-infinity, infinity) - [2, 11])) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-5, -3, 0, 3, 4, 9})))");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("{-5, -3, 0, 3, 4, 9} U (1, 14)");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("[2, 11] - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-5, -3, 0, 3, 4, 9}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - ((1, 14)))");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

[`19*4+2/12`] is equal to [_____]{answer=>Real(76.1666666667),width=>5}
---

[`13.41+2-16.44-19/3.2`] is equal to [_____]{Real(-6.9675)}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-5, -3, 0, 3, 4, 9\}`]
- [`B = \{x | 2 \leq x \leq 11\}`]
- [`C = \{x | 1 < x < 14\}`]

Compute:
- [`C - (B \cup B \cup (C \cup C \cup A \cap B) \cap A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`A \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}
- [`B \cap A \cap (C) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-1, 1, 3\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \leq 12\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup ((((A \cap A) \cap (A \cup (A \cup A)))) \cup ((B \cup A \cup A \cap B) \cup B \cup A) \cap B) \cup (B \cup A) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`A \cap A \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}
- [`B \cup A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -1, 2, 2 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle -3, 2, -9 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle -2, 1, -9 \rangle `]

Compute:
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-3, 2, -9>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- [` \left\| \vec{u} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<-1, 2, 2>"))}
- [` \vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-1, 2, 2>") . Compute("<-3, 2, -9>")}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-1, 2, 2>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<-2, 1, -9>"))}
- [` \vec{w} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-2, 1, -9>") . Compute("<-3, 2, -9>")}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle 0, -4, 9 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle -2, 0, -1 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{w} = \langle -5, 2, 5 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \left\| \vec{w} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<-5, 2, 5>"))}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{w} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-5, 2, 5>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<0, -4, 9>") x Compute("<-2, 0, -1>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<0, -4, 9>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- [` \vec{w} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-5, 2, 5>") x Compute("<0, -4, 9>")}
- [` \vec{v} \cdot \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-2, 0, -1>") . Compute("<0, -4, 9>")}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_1]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_2]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->D()}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
